<title>USA: TABLE - MetroWest Bank Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - MetroWest Bank Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended	Six Months Ended</p>
